m what it describes. Here a page is only the regions its view names, read from signed lines and receipts, so a page moves only when a line does, and the line says who moved it.\" at=witness:a-documents-world-born-as-a-world by=target form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/doc/idea value=lock\nbound-lock/1 about=\"Why pages are lines\" at=witness:a-documents-world-born-as-a-world by=target form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/doc/idea/heading value=lock\nbound-lock/1 about=\"A README from five lines\" at=witness:a-documents-world-born-as-a-world by=target form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/doc/figure/world/heading value=lock\nbound-lock/1 about=\"a place adopts it with {scope}\" at=witness:a-documents-world-born-as-a-world by=target form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/doc/figure/world/adopted value=lock\nbound-lock/1 about=\"[The whole example]({at})\" at=witness:a-documents-world-born-as-a-world by=target form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/doc/figure/learn/source value=lock\nbound-lock/1 about=\"What it claims\" at=witness:a-documents-world-born-as-a-world by=target form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/doc/claims/heading value=lock\nbound-lock/1 about=\"It costs {dependencies} dependencies: the algebra its cells are read by and the SDK it answers through\" at=witness:a-documents-world-born-as-a-world by=target form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/doc/claims/1-costs value=lock\nbound-lock/1 about=receipt at=witness:a-documents-world-born-as-a-world by=target form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/doc/claims/receipt value=lock\nbound-lock/1 about=\"How to read it\" at=witness:a-documents-world-born-as-a-world by=target form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/doc/reading/heading value=lock\nbound-lock/1 about=\"topos-doc is read one region at a time, and each answers one question.\" at=witness:a-documents-world-born-as-a-world by=target form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/doc/reading/lead value=lock\nbound-lock/1 about=\"**{name}** · {answer}\" at=witness:a-documents-world-born-as-a-world by=target form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/doc/reading/view value=lock\nbound-lock/1 about=\"It rests on {names}.\" at=witness:a-documents-world-born-as-a-world by=target form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/doc/rests/on value=lock\nbound-lock/1 at=policy:render-world by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=wire/provider-inputs value=standing-projection@1\nbound-lock/1 at=policy:document-sample-lines by=target form=alphabet measure=reads role=writes scope=region/sample-lines value=*.json\nbound-lock/1 at=policy:document-sample-lines by=target form=alphabet measure=writes role=writes scope=region/sample-lines value=said/lines"
